e go compiler to escape the variable to the heap and put pressure on the garbage collector.\nとはかいてあるけどさ。","ts":"1616982429.246100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X4n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a55c1aa4-e9a7-412d-9d20-69d1ff3a53e2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"エスケープ解析の結果くらい記事に乗せてくれると良いよね。","ts":"1616982395.245900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MFS9Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b6bbfab-1b05-4752-bc94-4ed40c09c764","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; それとbyCopyでコピーが実際には起こってない可能性ないかな?\n\u0026gt; インライン展開して最適化で直上書き、みたいな。\nたしかに、最適化されている可能性がありますね","ts":"1616982347.245300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LPwgF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67afd33d-6587-47b4-8c92-a21b3d70880d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; アロケーションの有無が影響しているだけでは。\nなるほど\nポインタがヒープに展開されるから、アロケーションされるためか","ts":"1616982186.244800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nTC88"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e68fe343-ec84-4858-84af-97c97cac1293","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"インライン展開して最適化で直上書き、みたいな。","ts":"1616981726.243800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1xpk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc1b775f-7be4-4df8-8ad2-c760a0658bb4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それとbyCopyでコピーが実際には起こってない可能性ないかな?","ts":"1616981693.243300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k5cu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4aaa103f-32e1-411d-b88a-1a2840f6ddab","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"アロケーションの有無が影響しているだけでは。","ts":"1616981575.242600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L+V"}